Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.14,0:00:10.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Erase the words to be \Ntorn asunder at the root.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:11.27,0:00:14.26,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Rid all meaning from the \Nrain that takes shape.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.19,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let all cycles return as cycles.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Abide by my laws, all that may arise.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.78,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Ai terminat?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.78,0:00:30.48,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.95,0:00:35.39,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This should negate all external attacks, \Nbe they physical or magical.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.08,0:00:40.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,As long as I remain alive, \Nno other human can break this spell.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.84,0:00:43.38,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Sounds like practically cheating.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.17,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You made a contract with a witch.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.83,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This is the least I could do.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:47.30,0:00:52.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That said, you're still vulnerable \Nto poison and psychological attacks.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.78,0:00:54.38,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,So do be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Not too shabby for an apprentice mage.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.00,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's my cover story within the palace.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.47,0:01:06.72,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,However, I left the tower to lift \Nyour curse, as your protector.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.28,0:01:08.97,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.25,0:01:13.06,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,All I want is for you to marry me.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.23,0:01:16.96,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You know I said "no," right?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Finding a successor sounds \Nlike a real problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.74,0:03:01.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone else \Nwho's part of the royal bloodline?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.18,0:03:04.86,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I seem to recall there \Nbeing a few branch families.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.03,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,About fifteen years ago,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.03,0:03:11.16,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,there was a series of cases where babies \Ndisappeared around the kingdom.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.59,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Fifteen years ago, you say...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.59,0:03:20.31,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,It was then that His Highness's \Ncousins all went missing.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.80,0:03:25.36,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,As a result, there aren't any royals left \Nwho are younger than he is.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.72,Default-Top,Kav,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.41,Default-Top,Kav,0,0,0,,Sylvia, how are you faring?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.94,Default-Top,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I've almost got it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.26,0:03:50.19,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.81,0:03:53.93,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.51,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.78,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,She did that without an incantation?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.51,0:03:59.78,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.73,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Miss Tinasha, was it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.73,0:04:03.68,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.32,0:04:07.26,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,His Highness brought her \Nfrom the witch's tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.38,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Witch's tower?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.00,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.94,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your rest.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.36,0:04:15.03,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,You really helped me out.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.37,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Pay it no mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.37,0:04:19.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm always happy to do this much.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.07,0:04:27.92,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,A sparring match?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.96,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,General Als and Meredina, looks like.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.80,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He's quite the fighter.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.05,0:04:40.15,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,He's one of the younger generals, \Nbut the most skilled of them all.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.81,0:04:44.23,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,Though His Highness is \Nstronger than General Als.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.69,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.31,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,What's with that reaction?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.65,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oh, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.16,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No wonder he conquered the tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.82,0:04:59.12,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.12,0:05:02.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Some sword practice sounds nice \Nabout now, after so long.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.77,0:05:03.82,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.37,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.55,0:05:14.71,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let's go again.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.88,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,You seem too good to be just a dabbler.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.63,0:05:30.95,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,If you joined us instead of being a mage, \Nyou'd fit in just fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.64,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Thanks for the kind words.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.20,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Well? How was she?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.52,0:05:40.51,Default-Top,Als,0,0,0,,You saw for yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.41,Default-Top,Als,0,0,0,,She's obviously more than just \NHis Highness's prize pet.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.99,0:05:47.37,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,I heard she's the pupil of a witch.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.75,0:05:48.95,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.77,0:05:52.96,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Jealousy doesn't suit you, Meredina.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.92,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.62,0:06:02.54,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Litola. You were here?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.07,0:06:09.91,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're well.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.94,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,You've found a fine individual, it seems.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.32,0:06:14.65,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.35,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying \Nyourself much more now.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.28,0:06:20.79,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.54,0:06:25.50,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Well, it's not bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.83,0:06:27.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.45,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.82,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,There's something I thought you should know.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.43,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Is that you, Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.43,0:06:39.86,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Did you get a good work...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.26,0:06:41.03,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,out...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.51,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.51,0:06:45.03,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.89,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving for two or three days.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.89,0:06:49.06,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hold on, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.06,0:06:50.10,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.10,0:06:52.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm free to go where I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.81,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll make sure I come back.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.81,0:06:55.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I formed a contract with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.59,0:06:57.57,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't have you leaving at any time.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.57,0:07:00.28,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,At least tell me where you're headed.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.97,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The magical lake in Druza.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.12,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,The magical lake?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.63,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.63,0:07:14.33,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,That's where the demonic beast \Nwas sealed away seventy years ago!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.22,0:07:21.42,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,There are large surges of \Nhigh magical power occurring there.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.76,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm off to find out who's responsible \Nand what they're plotting.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.72,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll join you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.67,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.67,0:07:31.73,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The crown prince shouldn't venture out, anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.08,0:07:34.81,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,That land is effectively \Nunder Farsas jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.81,0:07:38.19,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Even with my word, the state won't \Ntake kindly to you investigating alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.68,0:07:42.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If the two of us go, it might \Nbecome an even bigger problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.24,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll gather able soldiers.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.24,0:07:47.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm not obligated to protect \Nanyone other than you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.46,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.06,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,One hour.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.06,0:07:56.76,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I won't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.28,0:08:11.52,Dialogue,Miralys,0,0,0,,What do you expect to find out here, Valt?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.40,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,Nothing visible to the naked eye.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.40,0:08:16.68,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,But it's about to begin.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.69,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,She should take notice pretty soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.22,Dialogue,Miralys,0,0,0,,The Witch of the Azure Moon?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.22,0:08:26.05,Dialogue,Miralys,0,0,0,,Will she really come all this way?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.05,0:08:26.90,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,Yes, she will.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.34,0:08:31.62,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,She has eyes all across the mainland.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.02,0:08:35.28,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,After all, she's looking for him as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.26,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.75,0:08:52.14,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Is that a dragon you have on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.25,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.10,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,My name is Sylvia.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.09,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We haven't spoken, have we?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.14,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.58,0:09:00.88,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.07,0:09:04.03,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,How amazing.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.03,0:09:05.53,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It's my first time seeing one!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.84,0:09:09.12,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Th... There, there...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.71,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.71,0:09:16.02,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's not used to people, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.69,0:09:17.62,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.81,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.81,0:09:22.53,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was going to ride it if I was going alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.53,0:09:24.84,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,It doesn't look big enough to ride.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.55,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We're embarking on a survey \Nof the magical lake in Druza.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.68,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We don't know \Nwhat we'll find, so stay vigilant.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.62,0:09:35.04,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Also, don't go against her orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.70,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to say that?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.36,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.71,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You really are a strange man.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.59,0:09:48.07,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.10,0:09:49.83,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.15,Dialogue,Regius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Să mergem, Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.37,0:10:02.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like dust in the wind,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.78,0:10:05.09,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}no one back then is still alive.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.58,0:10:10.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so, everything I know leaves me behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.14,0:10:14.63,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, I remain in the same place.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the path I chose for myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.50,0:10:20.94,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go, Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.40,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.51,0:10:28.82,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.16,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.94,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Your Highness, look at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.94,0:10:48.71,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.51,0:10:50.39,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.91,0:10:51.62,Dialogue,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.39,0:10:57.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Seventy years ago, the neighboring \Nnation of Druza invaded Farsas.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.39,0:11:02.81,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}As Farsas drove back the enemy \Nwith a steady army,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.81,0:11:06.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Druza unleashed their giant \Nmagic weapon, a demonic beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.27,0:11:10.38,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The beast, not fully \Nunder control, was let loose,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.38,0:11:14.10,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}laying waste to foes, \Nallies, and the land itself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.68,0:11:18.95,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ultimately, the beast was sealed away \Nby the Witch of the Azure Moon,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.35,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}but its miasma poisoned the earth,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.35,0:11:24.70,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}turning it into a barren \Nwasteland devoid of any life.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.96,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What a sight to behold.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.58,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's a nightmare come to life.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.40,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,This is where that demonic beast is sealed?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.84,0:11:34.69,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It was a formidable opponent.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.69,0:11:38.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,With humans in the area, it was \Nall I could do to seal it away.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.69,0:11:41.39,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If I had kept on fighting back then,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.39,0:11:44.27,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,the outcome would have \Nbeen much more gruesome.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.11,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.50,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I know you're there.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.50,0:11:51.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and show yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.57,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.57,0:11:58.03,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.03,0:12:02.50,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nu credeam că voi ajunge să te reîntâlnesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.50,0:12:05.30,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Rochia ta, frumusetea ta...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.31,0:12:08.96,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Parcă m-am întors în timp cu 70 de ani,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.92,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoare a Lunii Albastre.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.28,0:12:12.99,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoare?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.38,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.38,0:12:18.04,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Iar tu ai îmbătrânit bine de tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.04,0:12:20.35,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sau ar trebui să spun că te-ai stafidit?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,La acea vreme, erai doar un copilaș.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.31,0:12:28.01,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,În mod normal, ar fi trebuit să fiu mort de mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.01,0:12:32.09,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Dar, vezi tu, noi nu suntem ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.09,0:12:35.74,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Văd că ai urmat același drum ca și maestrul tău, după cum arăți si vorbești.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.74,0:12:39.81,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Te referi la cel căruia i-ai tăiat capul?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.81,0:12:42.70,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Mă bucur să aud asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.27,0:12:44.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,În acest caz, îți voi face o favoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.56,0:12:47.79,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Îți voi oferi același destin.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.74,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Vai, cât de înfricoșătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.74,0:12:56.30,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I'm not powerful enough to \Nhandle you, so I'll take my leave.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.30,0:13:00.62,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I suggest that all of you \Ndepart this place, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.62,0:13:06.19,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you need to be \Nconvinced with a death or two.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.14,0:13:07.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.55,0:13:18.24,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.20,0:13:22.08,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.24,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.07,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.07,0:13:37.09,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.43,0:13:38.78,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He got away.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.78,0:13:39.94,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.12,0:13:45.60,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He was one of Druza's mages \Ncontrolling the beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.46,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,So that surge of magical power...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.77,0:13:53.23,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Most likely, it's the result \Nof trying to revive the beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.03,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Revenge after seventy years, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.03,0:13:57.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.20,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Some first-aid treatment.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.11,0:14:03.91,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Miss Tinasha, you're a witch?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.82,0:14:09.49,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,By the way, did you let your arm \Ntake the hit on purpose?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.49,0:14:10.92,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Attacks don't affect me, do they?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.85,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I kept it a secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.68,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I didn't want to startle anyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.01,0:14:27.89,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That's not it! I...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You mustn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.32,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Witches are objects of fear.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.28,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.50,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's retreat for now.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.58,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We'll gather forces and arm ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.58,0:14:45.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll go after that mage.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.91,0:14:47.20,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.46,0:14:52.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Now that we're onto them, they'll try to \Nundo the seal as fast as they can.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.02,0:14:57.17,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.17,0:14:58.76,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.34,0:15:04.09,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I know you're very capable, \Nand I admire your willingness.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.68,0:15:09.06,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,But if you're going to become king, \Nyou need to learn to delegate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.58,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.58,0:15:12.02,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.32,0:15:15.23,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I won't have you do all the dirty work for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.23,0:15:18.23,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you dragged me out of my tower?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.59,0:15:21.95,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Their target is Farsas.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.95,0:15:24.32,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't have you bear that burden alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.62,0:15:28.03,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.16,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You really are so stubborn.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.80,0:15:33.39,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Our contract is only for one year.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.88,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Feel free to have me solve \Nyour troubles while I'm here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.35,0:15:37.72,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.72,0:15:42.59,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Besides, the weight of your \Nburdens is nothing to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.42,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.42,0:15:49.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You and I are bound by our contract, \Nand as long as I am your protector,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.31,0:15:54.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I will always return to you, \Nno matter what I do or where I go.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.14,0:15:57.58,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,And I won't die before you do.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.46,0:15:59.53,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's for certain.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.19,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I understand. Go on.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.19,0:16:04.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.03,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Nark.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.76,0:16:16.38,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha, when you come back...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.38,0:16:17.58,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.46,0:16:19.96,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We should get married.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.96,0:16:21.29,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,N-Not happening!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't jinx yourself like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.10,0:16:32.06,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Hurry and break the final seal!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.27,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.27,0:16:36.23,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,The control spell isn't fully ready yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.23,0:16:37.71,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.43,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,The witch found us!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.42,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,The witch?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.15,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.07,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.07,0:16:46.24,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Break the seal on the beast \Nbefore they storm in here!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.24,0:16:49.10,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,Begone, definiens!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.46,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.46,0:16:57.88,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I'll make sure power is restored to Druza, \Nwith help from the demonic beast!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.87,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I won't let it end \Nnow that we've come this far!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.84,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Looks like I missed one.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.25,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.25,0:17:20.12,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You want to undo the seal?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll break it for you, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,As it stands, I can't lay \Na finger on it, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sing for me, ancient forewarning.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.24,0:17:34.41,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Chains born in days bygone, \Ncrumble by my command.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.68,0:17:50.90,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stay away until it's all over.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's been seventy years.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.18,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Did you have a pleasant slumber?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.83,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's one bushy mane.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.59,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Brim forth, my definition!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.60,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Burst!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.40,0:18:51.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}It heals as fast as ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.98,0:18:52.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.51,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Rise up.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.51,0:18:57.33,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The cage that confines you \Nhides yet in darkness.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.71,0:19:00.96,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Your view shows naught \Nbut these seven shackles.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.67,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Tranquility is blind without meaning.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.83,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Slumber in the cave of ignorance you rejected.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.86,0:19:10.38,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this time, you must die.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.80,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You have nothing to gain from living here.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.90,0:19:17.28,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Recognize my will as command.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Silence brimming in ubiquity.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.87,0:19:23.72,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You hold no power without my words.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.72,0:19:26.46,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Define the light that extinguishes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.78,0:19:34.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.03,0:19:53.13,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.09,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Someone call for a mage!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.38,0:20:08.11,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,You may enter.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.14,0:20:10.28,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.75,0:20:11.98,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,How's Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.99,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I've performed a full body examination.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.39,0:20:16.41,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I couldn't find any severe wounds.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.48,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,No wounds?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.48,0:20:20.30,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What about her stomach?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.67,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It looks like she patched herself up.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.67,0:20:25.77,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I can't tell how it looks on the inside.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.77,0:20:26.67,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.90,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Can I go check up on her?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.90,0:20:30.83,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.83,0:20:34.86,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I can't imagine she'll come to until she's \Nrecovered her magical power, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.58,0:20:44.85,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha. Are you awak—
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.46,0:20:52.64,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.34,0:20:58.16,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't come in while I'm naked!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.58,0:21:03.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I had suffered severe organ damage,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.07,0:21:06.29,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,so I recovered by accelerating \Nmy bodily growth.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.23,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Organ damage?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.23,0:21:09.50,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:09.50,0:21:10.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm all better now.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just a little anemic from all the bleeding.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.46,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Will your appearance change back?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.42,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.42,0:21:22.22,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,My appearance was due to halting my growth.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.71,0:21:26.44,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tu chiar ai învins creaturile demonice...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:26.87,0:21:27.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Floare la ureche.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.77,0:21:29.86,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What about that deadly injury?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.78,0:21:34.96,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Ne-ai salvat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.71,0:21:38.14,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Datorită ție nimeni altcineva nu a fost rănit.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.60,0:21:40.52,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Măcar atât să pot face.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.00,0:21:47.46,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Doar sunt o vrăjitoare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:03.99,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Castelul Farsas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.01,0:00:03.99,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Reședința lui Oscar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:53.03,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Reamintirea Trecutului
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:33.40,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Kav
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:33.40,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Mag al Farsasului
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:37.37,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Sylvia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:37.37,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Mag al Farsasului
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.83,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Meredina
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.83,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Ofițer al Farsasului
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.83,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Als
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.83,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,General al Farsasului
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:46.00,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Fortăreața Ynureid
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:46.00,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Nord-vestul Farsasului, la graniță cu Druza
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:01.95,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Mag al Druzaului
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:41.03,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Despre ce visează pădurea
Dialogue: 99,0:00:08.14,0:00:10.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Erase the words to be \Ntorn asunder at the root.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:11.27,0:00:14.26,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Rid all meaning from the \Nrain that takes shape.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.19,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let all cycles return as cycles.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.12,0:00:21.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Abide by my laws, all that may arise.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.44,0:00:29.78,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Ai terminat?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:29.78,0:00:30.48,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.95,0:00:35.39,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This should negate all external attacks, \Nbe they physical or magical.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.08,0:00:40.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,As long as I remain alive, \Nno other human can break this spell.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:40.84,0:00:43.38,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Sounds like practically cheating.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.17,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You made a contract with a witch.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.83,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This is the least I could do.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:47.30,0:00:52.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That said, you're still vulnerable \Nto poison and psychological attacks.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.78,0:00:54.38,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,So do be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Not too shabby for an apprentice mage.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.50,0:01:01.00,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's my cover story within the palace.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.47,0:01:06.72,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,However, I left the tower to lift \Nyour curse, as your protector.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:07.28,0:01:08.97,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't forget that.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.25,0:01:13.06,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,All I want is for you to marry me.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:14.23,0:01:16.96,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You know I said "no," right?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Finding a successor sounds \Nlike a real problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:57.74,0:03:01.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Isn't there anyone else \Nwho's part of the royal bloodline?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:02.18,0:03:04.86,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I seem to recall there \Nbeing a few branch families.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:05.38,0:03:07.03,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,About fifteen years ago,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.03,0:03:11.16,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,there was a series of cases where babies \Ndisappeared around the kingdom.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.59,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Fifteen years ago, you say...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:14.59,0:03:20.31,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,It was then that His Highness's \Ncousins all went missing.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.80,0:03:25.36,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,As a result, there aren't any royals left \Nwho are younger than he is.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.44,0:03:31.72,Default-Top,Kav,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.41,Default-Top,Kav,0,0,0,,Sylvia, how are you faring?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:36.12,0:03:38.94,Default-Top,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I've almost got it.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:49.26,0:03:50.19,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:52.81,0:03:53.93,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.51,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:55.51,0:03:57.78,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,She did that without an incantation?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:58.51,0:03:59.78,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:00.03,0:04:02.73,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Miss Tinasha, was it?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:02.73,0:04:03.68,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:04.32,0:04:07.26,Dialogue,Kav,0,0,0,,His Highness brought her \Nfrom the witch's tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.26,0:04:08.38,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Witch's tower?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.78,0:04:10.00,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.94,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your rest.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.36,0:04:15.03,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,You really helped me out.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.66,0:04:17.37,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Pay it no mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:17.37,0:04:19.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm always happy to do this much.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:26.07,0:04:27.92,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,A sparring match?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:28.19,0:04:30.96,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,General Als and Meredina, looks like.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.80,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He's quite the fighter.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.05,0:04:40.15,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,He's one of the younger generals, \Nbut the most skilled of them all.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:40.81,0:04:44.23,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,Though His Highness is \Nstronger than General Als.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.54,0:04:45.69,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.31,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,What's with that reaction?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:48.84,0:04:50.65,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oh, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:52.90,0:04:55.16,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No wonder he conquered the tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.82,0:04:59.12,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.12,0:05:02.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Some sword practice sounds nice \Nabout now, after so long.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.77,0:05:03.82,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.37,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.55,0:05:14.71,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Let's go again.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.28,0:05:25.88,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,You seem too good to be just a dabbler.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.63,0:05:30.95,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,If you joined us instead of being a mage, \Nyou'd fit in just fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.22,0:05:33.64,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Thanks for the kind words.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.20,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Well? How was she?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.52,0:05:40.51,Default-Top,Als,0,0,0,,You saw for yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.51,0:05:44.41,Default-Top,Als,0,0,0,,She's obviously more than just \NHis Highness's prize pet.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:44.99,0:05:47.37,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,I heard she's the pupil of a witch.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:47.75,0:05:48.95,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Is this really okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.77,0:05:52.96,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Jealousy doesn't suit you, Meredina.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.92,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:01.62,0:06:02.54,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Litola. You were here?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.07,0:06:09.91,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you're well.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.94,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,You've found a fine individual, it seems.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.32,0:06:14.65,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.35,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,You seem to be enjoying \Nyourself much more now.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.28,0:06:20.79,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I guess you could say that...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.54,0:06:25.50,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Well, it's not bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:26.83,0:06:27.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:27.75,0:06:28.45,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.82,Dialogue,Litola,0,0,0,,There's something I thought you should know.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.43,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Is that you, Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.43,0:06:39.86,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Did you get a good work...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:40.26,0:06:41.03,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,out...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:42.15,0:06:43.51,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.51,0:06:45.03,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why are you dressed like that?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.75,0:06:47.89,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving for two or three days.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:47.89,0:06:49.06,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hold on, now.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:49.06,0:06:50.10,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:50.10,0:06:52.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm free to go where I want.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:52.15,0:06:53.81,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll make sure I come back.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.81,0:06:55.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I formed a contract with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.59,0:06:57.57,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't have you leaving at any time.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:57.57,0:07:00.28,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,At least tell me where you're headed.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.97,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The magical lake in Druza.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.97,0:07:09.12,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,The magical lake?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.60,0:07:10.63,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.63,0:07:14.33,Dialogue,Lazar,0,0,0,,That's where the demonic beast \Nwas sealed away seventy years ago!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:18.22,0:07:21.42,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,There are large surges of \Nhigh magical power occurring there.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:21.42,0:07:25.76,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm off to find out who's responsible \Nand what they're plotting.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:26.20,0:07:27.72,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll join you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.97,0:07:29.67,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That won't be necessary.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:29.67,0:07:31.73,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The crown prince shouldn't venture out, anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.08,0:07:34.81,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,That land is effectively \Nunder Farsas jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:34.81,0:07:38.19,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Even with my word, the state won't \Ntake kindly to you investigating alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:38.68,0:07:42.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If the two of us go, it might \Nbecome an even bigger problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.24,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll gather able soldiers.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.24,0:07:47.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm not obligated to protect \Nanyone other than you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.46,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:53.55,0:07:55.06,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,One hour.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.06,0:07:56.76,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I won't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:08.28,0:08:11.52,Dialogue,Miralys,0,0,0,,What do you expect to find out here, Valt?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.52,0:08:14.40,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,Nothing visible to the naked eye.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.40,0:08:16.68,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,But it's about to begin.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.69,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,She should take notice pretty soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.22,Dialogue,Miralys,0,0,0,,The Witch of the Azure Moon?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.22,0:08:26.05,Dialogue,Miralys,0,0,0,,Will she really come all this way?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:26.05,0:08:26.90,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,Yes, she will.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:28.34,0:08:31.62,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,She has eyes all across the mainland.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:32.02,0:08:35.28,Dialogue,Valt,0,0,0,,After all, she's looking for him as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.26,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.75,0:08:52.14,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Is that a dragon you have on your shoulder?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.25,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:53.25,0:08:55.10,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,My name is Sylvia.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.09,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,We haven't spoken, have we?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.14,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:59.58,0:09:00.88,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.07,0:09:04.03,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,How amazing.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.03,0:09:05.53,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It's my first time seeing one!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:05.84,0:09:09.12,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Th... There, there...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.71,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.71,0:09:16.02,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's not used to people, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.69,0:09:17.62,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.32,0:09:19.81,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:19.81,0:09:22.53,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was going to ride it if I was going alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:22.53,0:09:24.84,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,It doesn't look big enough to ride.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.55,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We're embarking on a survey \Nof the magical lake in Druza.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.68,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We don't know \Nwhat we'll find, so stay vigilant.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:31.62,0:09:35.04,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Also, don't go against her orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.35,0:09:38.70,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to say that?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.70,0:09:39.36,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:41.50,0:09:43.71,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You really are a strange man.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:44.86,0:09:46.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:46.59,0:09:48.07,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.10,0:09:49.83,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:49.83,0:09:51.15,Dialogue,Regius,0,0,0,,{\i1}Să mergem, Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.37,0:10:02.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Like dust in the wind,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:02.78,0:10:05.09,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}no one back then is still alive.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:05.58,0:10:10.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}And so, everything I know leaves me behind.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:11.14,0:10:14.63,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Still, I remain in the same place.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:15.47,0:10:18.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the path I chose for myself.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:19.50,0:10:20.94,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go, Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.40,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.51,0:10:28.82,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.58,0:10:32.16,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.94,Dialogue,Als,0,0,0,,Your Highness, look at that.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:47.94,0:10:48.71,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:49.51,0:10:50.39,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.91,0:10:51.62,Dialogue,Group,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:53.39,0:10:57.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Seventy years ago, the neighboring \Nnation of Druza invaded Farsas.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:58.39,0:11:02.81,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}As Farsas drove back the enemy \Nwith a steady army,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.81,0:11:06.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Druza unleashed their giant \Nmagic weapon, a demonic beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.27,0:11:10.38,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}The beast, not fully \Nunder control, was let loose,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.38,0:11:14.10,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}laying waste to foes, \Nallies, and the land itself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:14.68,0:11:18.95,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Ultimately, the beast was sealed away \Nby the Witch of the Azure Moon,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.35,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}but its miasma poisoned the earth,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:21.35,0:11:24.70,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}turning it into a barren \Nwasteland devoid of any life.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.96,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What a sight to behold.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.27,0:11:29.58,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,It's a nightmare come to life.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.07,0:11:32.40,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,This is where that demonic beast is sealed?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:32.84,0:11:34.69,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It was a formidable opponent.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:34.69,0:11:38.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,With humans in the area, it was \Nall I could do to seal it away.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:38.69,0:11:41.39,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If I had kept on fighting back then,
Dialogue: 99,0:11:41.39,0:11:44.27,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,the outcome would have \Nbeen much more gruesome.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.11,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.50,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I know you're there.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:49.50,0:11:51.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and show yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.57,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:56.57,0:11:58.03,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:58.03,0:12:02.50,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nu credeam că voi ajunge să te reîntâlnesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:02.50,0:12:05.30,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Rochia ta, frumusetea ta...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:05.31,0:12:08.96,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Parcă m-am întors în timp cu 70 de ani,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.92,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoare a Lunii Albastre.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.28,0:12:12.99,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Vrăjitoare?!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.38,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:14.38,0:12:18.04,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Iar tu ai îmbătrânit bine de tot.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.04,0:12:20.35,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sau ar trebui să spun că te-ai stafidit?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:20.74,0:12:23.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,La acea vreme, erai doar un copilaș.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.31,0:12:28.01,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,În mod normal, ar fi trebuit să fiu mort de mult.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:28.01,0:12:32.09,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Dar, vezi tu, noi nu suntem ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.09,0:12:35.74,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Văd că ai urmat același drum ca și maestrul tău, după cum arăți si vorbești.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:35.74,0:12:39.81,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Te referi la cel căruia i-ai tăiat capul?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.81,0:12:42.70,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Mă bucur să aud asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:43.27,0:12:44.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,În acest caz, îți voi face o favoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:45.56,0:12:47.79,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Îți voi oferi același destin.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:48.56,0:12:50.74,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Vai, cât de înfricoșătoare.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.74,0:12:56.30,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I'm not powerful enough to \Nhandle you, so I'll take my leave.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:56.30,0:13:00.62,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I suggest that all of you \Ndepart this place, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.62,0:13:06.19,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Or perhaps you need to be \Nconvinced with a death or two.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:07.14,0:13:07.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stand back!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:17.55,0:13:18.24,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:21.20,0:13:22.08,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.24,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:34.99,0:13:36.07,Dialogue,Meredina,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:36.07,0:13:37.09,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:37.43,0:13:38.78,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He got away.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:38.78,0:13:39.94,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.12,0:13:45.60,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He was one of Druza's mages \Ncontrolling the beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.46,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,So that surge of magical power...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:48.77,0:13:53.23,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Most likely, it's the result \Nof trying to revive the beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.23,0:13:56.03,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Revenge after seventy years, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.03,0:13:57.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I believe so.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.20,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Some first-aid treatment.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.11,0:14:03.91,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Miss Tinasha, you're a witch?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.82,0:14:09.49,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,By the way, did you let your arm \Ntake the hit on purpose?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:09.49,0:14:10.92,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Attacks don't affect me, do they?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.85,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I kept it a secret.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.68,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I didn't want to startle anyone.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.01,0:14:27.89,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,That's not it! I...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You mustn't.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.32,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Witches are objects of fear.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:35.98,0:14:37.28,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.50,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Let's retreat for now.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.58,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We'll gather forces and arm ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:43.58,0:14:45.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll go after that mage.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.91,0:14:47.20,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:47.46,0:14:52.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Now that we're onto them, they'll try to \Nundo the seal as fast as they can.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:56.02,0:14:57.17,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:57.17,0:14:58.76,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:59.34,0:15:04.09,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I know you're very capable, \Nand I admire your willingness.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:04.68,0:15:09.06,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,But if you're going to become king, \Nyou need to learn to delegate.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:09.06,0:15:10.58,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.58,0:15:12.02,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,But not now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.32,0:15:15.23,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I won't have you do all the dirty work for me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:15.23,0:15:18.23,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Isn't that why you dragged me out of my tower?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.59,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:19.59,0:15:21.95,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Their target is Farsas.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.95,0:15:24.32,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I can't have you bear that burden alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:26.62,0:15:28.03,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I swear.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:28.03,0:15:30.16,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You really are so stubborn.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:30.80,0:15:33.39,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Our contract is only for one year.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:33.39,0:15:35.88,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Feel free to have me solve \Nyour troubles while I'm here.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:36.35,0:15:37.72,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.72,0:15:42.59,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Besides, the weight of your \Nburdens is nothing to me.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.10,0:15:44.42,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:44.42,0:15:49.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You and I are bound by our contract, \Nand as long as I am your protector,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.31,0:15:54.31,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I will always return to you, \Nno matter what I do or where I go.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:55.14,0:15:57.58,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,And I won't die before you do.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:58.46,0:15:59.53,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's for certain.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:01.92,0:16:04.19,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I understand. Go on.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:04.19,0:16:04.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:07.23,0:16:08.03,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Nark.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:13.76,0:16:16.38,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha, when you come back...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:16.38,0:16:17.58,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.46,0:16:19.96,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,We should get married.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.96,0:16:21.29,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,N-Not happening!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:21.29,0:16:23.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't jinx yourself like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:29.10,0:16:32.06,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Hurry and break the final seal!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.27,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:33.27,0:16:36.23,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,The control spell isn't fully ready yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:36.23,0:16:37.71,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.71,0:16:39.43,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,The witch found us!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.42,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,The witch?!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.15,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.07,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:42.07,0:16:46.24,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,Break the seal on the beast \Nbefore they storm in here!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:46.24,0:16:49.10,Dialogue,Mage,0,0,0,,Begone, definiens!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.46,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,It's not too late.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:52.46,0:16:57.88,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I'll make sure power is restored to Druza, \Nwith help from the demonic beast!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.87,Dialogue,Old Mage,0,0,0,,I won't let it end \Nnow that we've come this far!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.84,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Looks like I missed one.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.00,0:17:18.25,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:18.25,0:17:20.12,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You want to undo the seal?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.32,0:17:23.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll break it for you, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.15,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,As it stands, I can't lay \Na finger on it, either.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sing for me, ancient forewarning.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:30.24,0:17:34.41,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Chains born in days bygone, \Ncrumble by my command.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:49.68,0:17:50.90,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.44,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Stay away until it's all over.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's been seventy years.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.18,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Did you have a pleasant slumber?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.83,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's one bushy mane.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.92,0:18:26.59,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Brim forth, my definition!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.60,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Burst!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.40,0:18:51.98,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}It heals as fast as ever.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:51.98,0:18:52.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 99,0:18:53.16,0:18:54.51,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Rise up.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.51,0:18:57.33,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The cage that confines you \Nhides yet in darkness.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:57.71,0:19:00.96,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Your view shows naught \Nbut these seven shackles.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:01.46,0:19:03.67,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Tranquility is blind without meaning.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:04.12,0:19:06.83,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Slumber in the cave of ignorance you rejected.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:07.86,0:19:10.38,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this time, you must die.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:10.83,0:19:13.80,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You have nothing to gain from living here.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:14.90,0:19:17.28,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Recognize my will as command.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.40,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Silence brimming in ubiquity.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:20.87,0:19:23.72,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You hold no power without my words.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:23.72,0:19:26.46,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Define the light that extinguishes.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:33.78,0:19:34.87,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:52.03,0:19:53.13,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.09,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Someone call for a mage!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.38,0:20:08.11,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,You may enter.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:09.14,0:20:10.28,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.75,0:20:11.98,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,How's Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.99,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I've performed a full body examination.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:14.39,0:20:16.41,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I couldn't find any severe wounds.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.48,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,No wounds?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.48,0:20:20.30,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What about her stomach?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:20.30,0:20:22.67,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,It looks like she patched herself up.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:22.67,0:20:25.77,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I can't tell how it looks on the inside.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:25.77,0:20:26.67,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:27.70,0:20:29.90,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Can I go check up on her?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:29.90,0:20:30.83,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:30.83,0:20:34.86,Dialogue,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I can't imagine she'll come to until she's \Nrecovered her magical power, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.58,0:20:44.85,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha. Are you awak—
Dialogue: 99,0:20:51.46,0:20:52.64,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:55.34,0:20:58.16,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't come in while I'm naked!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.58,0:21:03.07,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I had suffered severe organ damage,
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.07,0:21:06.29,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,so I recovered by accelerating \Nmy bodily growth.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.29,0:21:08.23,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Organ damage?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.23,0:21:09.50,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:09.50,0:21:10.75,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm all better now.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:11.24,0:21:13.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just a little anemic from all the bleeding.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.46,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Will your appearance change back?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.90,0:21:18.42,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:18.42,0:21:22.22,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,My appearance was due to halting my growth.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:23.71,0:21:26.44,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tu chiar ai învins creaturile demonice...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:26.87,0:21:27.77,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Floare la ureche.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.77,0:21:29.86,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,What about that deadly injury?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:33.78,0:21:34.96,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Ne-ai salvat.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:35.71,0:21:38.14,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Datorită ție nimeni altcineva nu a fost rănit.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:39.60,0:21:40.52,Dialogue,Oscar,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.91,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Măcar atât să pot face.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:46.00,0:21:47.46,Dialogue,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Doar sunt o vrăjitoare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.03,0:23:44.03,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,
